    "description": "Closed confusion set of genitive-plural forms (Rozental §154): nouns taking -ов/-ев frequently overgeneralized to a zero ending (апельсинов -> апельсин), and nouns taking a zero ending frequently hypercorrected with -ов (мест -> местов). 'norm' is the standard form the handler looks for; 'error' is the corrupted target. Nouns where both forms are accepted in the standard (e.g. грамм/граммов) are deliberately excluded.",
